   $q$According to the passage, how do beavers keep predators out of their lodge?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They pile heavy stones around every side of it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-detail"},{"text":"They flood the nearby roads so predators cannot pass.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"They build the lodge on dry land far from the pond.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"They build the lodge with entrances under the water.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They build the lodge with entrances under the water.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says the lodge has "underwater entrances that keep predators out." Stones are mentioned as dam material, not as protection for the lodge.$q$, 'draft', '2adc56ed-ca53-5229-88e8-fee9fe7f20ec')
