   $q$Based on the passage, why would scientists in dry regions build structures that copy beaver dams?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They want to replace beavers so the animals are not needed.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"They hope to trap more fish for nearby towns to catch.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"They hope dams will help streams keep flowing in dry seasons.","is_correct":true},{"text":"They want to flood farm fields to grow more water plants.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They hope dams will help streams keep flowing in dry seasons.$q$, $q$The paragraph explains that streams with dams often keep flowing in dry summers, and then mentions scientists in dry regions copying dams. The scientists hope "beavers will move in," so they are not trying to replace them.$q$, 'draft', '2adc56ed-ca53-5229-88e8-fee9fe7f20ec')
