  ('8d5c913e-2814-5fb2-8c44-23ae4e52c018', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g8-evidence-inference'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Which conclusion is best supported by the article as a whole?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The program has completely solved the school's waste problem.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"The principal started the compost program mainly to save money.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The salad bar now gets all of its vegetables from the garden.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-evidence"},{"text":"The program reduced trash and made soil, but it depends on steady student effort.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The program reduced trash and made soil, but it depends on steady student effort.$q$, $q$The article shows fewer trash bags and finished soil, and it also notes plastic problems on days without volunteers. It says only "some" vegetables reached the salad bar, and seven bags of trash a day is not a completely solved problem.$q$, 'draft', 'b05202f2-b3cd-56fa-8c59-0cb725edb085')
